+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * Copyright (c) 2022 MediaTek Inc.
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Collabora Ltd.
+ *                    AngeloGioacchino Del Regno <angelogioacchino.delregno@collabora.com>
