kvmalloc_array(n, sizeof(*ptr), GFP_KERNEL) with kvmalloc_objs()
in ip_vs_rht_alloc().

Compile tested with CONFIG_IP_VS=y and runtime tested using
tools/testing/selftests/net/netfilter/ipvs.sh on x86_64/QEMU.

